[{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其二十二","author":"王世贞","text":"火枣侑神梨，金浆调玉醴。\n但与许道士，不与许长史。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42510,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其二十三","author":"王世贞","text":"昔有郭崇子，誉雠愧雠死。\n德报固宽身，直斯可以已。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42511,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其二十四","author":"王世贞","text":"调达丈五身，劫火烧不息。\n一生无所为，与佛作功德。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42512,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其二十五","author":"王世贞","text":"赵州柏树子，强半嫌人死。\n脱得葛藤缠，走入齑瓮里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42513,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其二十六","author":"王世贞","text":"宗门伎俩尽，支离作曹洞。\n何似无心人，棒渴两不用。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42514,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其二十七","author":"王世贞","text":"达磨三遇毒，夫岂流支意。\n大道宁有町，并行不相悖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42515,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其二十八","author":"王世贞","text":"虽云却五辛，段食犹自宽。\n要和禅悦味，不在欢喜丸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42516,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其二十九","author":"王世贞","text":"纵无香积饭，不爱重思稻。\n天浆但入唇，人生何用饱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42517,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入秋无事案头偶有纸笔随意辄书如风扫华不伦不理故曰杂题 其三十","author":"王世贞","text":"出家夙世缘，抛官丈夫事。\n合眼四十年，裁能识吾弟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42518,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其一 石屏","author":"王世贞","text":"一夜点苍山，入君读书舍。\n芊眠白云色，而亲在其下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42519,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其二 琴","author":"王世贞","text":"谁言广陵散，便逐嵇生逝。\n小作三日思，归鸿渺然至。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42520,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其三 剑","author":"王世贞","text":"叶叶双芙蓉，半蚀土花碧。\n乍可千岁埋，不借一夫力。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42521,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其四 书笥","author":"王世贞","text":"一字少有余，五车多不足。\n七日暴君笥，何如晒君腹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42522,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其五 玉磬","author":"王世贞","text":"濯濯泗滨玉，泠泠时一拊。\n门有荷蒉言，汝心在千古。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42523,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其六 五岳图","author":"王世贞","text":"自谒上元归，不作向平想。\n俨然病维摩，阿閦在手掌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42524,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其七 棋","author":"王世贞","text":"欲知九枰胜，来自孤山媪。\n但赌宣城郡，不赌谢公墅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42525,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其八 胆瓶","author":"王世贞","text":"小小一军持，时露春消息。\n掷去色即空，插来空即色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42526,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其九 笛","author":"王世贞","text":"截彼君山竹，谱作潇湘思。\n他年遇阿猷，不得夸身贵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42527,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十 茶灶","author":"王世贞","text":"蟹眼犹未发，雀舌已芬敷。\n自炊还自啜，不爱文君垆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42528,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十一 螺杯","author":"王世贞","text":"君房鹦鹉杯，堪汝醉千日。\n那似壶公壶，易入还易出。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42529,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十二 琴石","author":"王世贞","text":"飒尔金飙过，嘐然冰弦响。\n彷佛百尺桐，仍栽峄山上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42530,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十三 博山垆","author":"王世贞","text":"匡床金博山，上有鹧鸪斑。\n轻飔约香雾，袅袅上云鬟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42531,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十四 麈尾","author":"王世贞","text":"爱君两手色，白于手中玉。\n第深无诤义，麈尾何必秃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42532,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十五 羽扇","author":"王世贞","text":"不愁秋气至，弃置归箧中。\n当时万里翮，扶摇快秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42533,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十六 芒屩","author":"王世贞","text":"笑他阮宣子，生平但蜡屐。\n何似芒屩轻，春原踏无迹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42534,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十七 芙蓉帐","author":"王世贞","text":"挑灯卷绡幕，朵朵秋花明。\n恍如挈仙侣，踏月芙蓉城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42535,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十八 湘竹簟","author":"王世贞","text":"玉臂展清辉，轻纹熨柔翠。\n不道香汗流，道是湘君泪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42536,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其十九 胡床","author":"王世贞","text":"胡郎坐胡床，却发庾公兴。\n冉冉南楼月，徐徐破残暝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42537,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为胡元瑞题绿萝馆二十咏 其二十 石枕","author":"王世贞","text":"枕此支机石，欲挹天浆冷。\n无奈泥丸翁，时时唤令醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42538,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一月弇园红梅盛开偶成 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"仲冬垄梅发，繁英簇红霰。\n过意百花魁，翻疑百花殿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42539,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一月弇园红梅盛开偶成 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"大小两黄鹂，公然吃花住。\n顷刻布同云，迷却来时路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42540,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻拱辰兄诗之来岁为辛巳秋有传举丈夫子者再得四绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"念无凌风翮，啖汝洗儿果。\n莫笑侬无功，一字珠一颗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42541,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻拱辰兄诗之来岁为辛巳秋有传举丈夫子者再得四绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"去家不百里，幽兰生郑谷。\n即看入梦后，荣庭尽芳玉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42542,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻拱辰兄诗之来岁为辛巳秋有传举丈夫子者再得四绝句 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"抱儿谒先公，了此宗祧寄。\n赢得七尺躯，别创千秋事。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42543,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻拱辰兄诗之来岁为辛巳秋有传举丈夫子者再得四绝句 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"人言此石丈，磊块无润色。\n我见重再拜，中孕连城璧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42544,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠松隐上人 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"为爱松隐名，去觅松隐迹。\n只在此松间，觌面不相识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42545,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠松隐上人 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"偶步九里松，忽闻清呗响。\n不见讽经人，声逗青松上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42546,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张五鹿三绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"屠生似北海，睥睨一世士。\n自过康成门，手标通德里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42547,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张五鹿三绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"授经何循循，标行乃岳岳。\n虽践五鹿称，畴忍折其角。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42548,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张五鹿三绝句 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"若个是何汤，老作受经生。\n一当天子问，推毂桓春卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42549,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其一 最景园","author":"王世贞","text":"归仗日月余，细割湖山胜。\n未论帝释园，人间许谁并。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42550,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其二 团云径","author":"王世贞","text":"白云滃作团，回风吹不散。\n截置一钵中，与作山僧饭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42551,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其三 苍雪坞","author":"王世贞","text":"团云变晴色，古木郁苍苍。\n未酬郢里倡，且奏梁园觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42552,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其四 丛兰馆","author":"王世贞","text":"幽馆寻欲迷，赖尔同心引。\n任是当门生，欲锄还不认。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42553,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其五 挹华轩","author":"王世贞","text":"水木旦夕华，兹轩巧相挹。\n为怜眉宇清，不惜琴樽湿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42554,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其六 爽然堂","author":"王世贞","text":"披襟纳雄风，咽如吸清冷。\n主人不喜醉，醉亦易为醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42555,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其七 专旭楼","author":"王世贞","text":"当头一镜悬，出没两轮疾。\n为借山色来，不作寻常日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42556,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其八 飧英馆","author":"王世贞","text":"人见黄菊开，几见黄菊落。\n欲得诗脾清，摘英和露嚼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42557,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其九 右军池","author":"王世贞","text":"水是右军池，人是右军裔。\n白麻昨夜干，黄庭榻来未。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42558,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和肖甫司马题旸德大参东园五言绝句十首 其十 通华径","author":"王世贞","text":"峭茜青葱间，所得亦已足。\n忽转天地开，锦绣匡山谷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42559,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题春雷出蛰图","author":"王世贞","text":"一夜春雷发，群蛰自相语。\n神龙岂不劳，人间要霖雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42560,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枝上小雀","author":"王世贞","text":"尺鴳栖一枝，粒粟俄已饱。\n却笑垂天鹏，饥飞何时了。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42561,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓼根蟹","author":"王世贞","text":"唼喋红蓼根，双螯利于手。\n横行能几何，终当堕人口。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42562,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送六君子 其一 送肖甫司马于清洋江口","author":"王世贞","text":"其奈清洋口，嘘为南北风。\n已无官可免，那不送羊公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42563,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送六君子 其二 再送伯玉至清洋口","author":"王世贞","text":"三年洗情字，一夕为君新。\n欲忍临岐泪，人间无此人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42564,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送六君子 其三 三送与绳至奣子","author":"王世贞","text":"人笑嵇生懒，胡然送巨源。\n归鸿君自看，依旧入苏门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42565,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送六君子 其四 四送明卿夜宿玉龙桥","author":"王世贞","text":"为少柴桑客，都令慧远骄。\n那知今夜月，已过虎溪桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42566,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送六君子 其五 五送本宁观潮南浦","author":"王世贞","text":"箫鼓下江门，江潮弄午喧。\n怕题南浦字，楚客易消魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42567,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送六君子 其六 六送桢仲于城西关","author":"王世贞","text":"请得葳蕤钥，踟蹰未忍还。\n亦知谯鼓急，词组万重山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42568,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前例送家弟敬美视闽中学然至北水关而止盖余已徙居乡故也","author":"王世贞","text":"祖席何妨远，依然北水门。\n信知情至处，一步也消魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42569,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"出语脍一世，不受儿辈悦。\n总为般若河，雅无文士筏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42570,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"圣如薄伽梵，狂如阿阇世。\n顺逆虽有殊，从儿得初地。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42571,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僧明智自吴明卿所来将谒海东补陀大士赠之得二首 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"汝从下雉来，欲作补陀参。\n风波了无际，惟有天蔚蓝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42572,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"僧明智自吴明卿所来将谒海东补陀大士赠之得二首 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"不知圆通老，道场在汝耳。\n一夜海潮音，我闻亦如是。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42573,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约圃杂咏五首 其一 媚清轩","author":"王世贞","text":"绿筱媚清涟，清涟媚绿筱。\n水竹两相媚，于中寄吾傲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42574,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约圃杂咏五首 其二 玉鳞馆","author":"王世贞","text":"夭矫五苍龙，一夜化为玉。\n欲乘向瑶池，懒不代吾足。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42575,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约圃杂咏五首 其三 烟鬟亭","author":"王世贞","text":"暝色团一丘，炊烟四无际。\n如入法华境，面面青螺髻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42576,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约圃杂咏五首 其四 欣托庐","author":"王世贞","text":"竹为众鸟欣，庐亦吾所爱。\n不作物我观，彼此两无碍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42577,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约圃杂咏五首 其五 适我轩","author":"王世贞","text":"于我既已适，于彼宁参差。\n惟当慕落际，我适彼不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42578,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送元驭阁老二十里桥同前例得一绝句","author":"王世贞","text":"欲作男儿别，将情强折磨。\n更堪天上泪，翻比世间多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42579,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇园杂咏四十三首 其一 清凉界","author":"王世贞","text":"步屧修竹林，银桥佛庐净。\n洒然忽清凉，是境还非境。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42580,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇园杂咏四十三首 其二 惹香径","author":"王世贞","text":"花气无不薰，偏与红妆娆。\n夜分乍解衣，宛是收香鸟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42581,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇园杂咏四十三首 其三 此君轩","author":"王世贞","text":"不可无此君，种得百千个。\n试与较风流，此君可无我。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42582,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇园杂咏四十三首 其四 会心处","author":"王世贞","text":"下有在藻鱼，上有啅花雀。\n历历如镜中，时时与心约。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42583,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇园杂咏四十三首 其五 玉兰台","author":"王世贞","text":"谢庭凡几树，羯末与封胡。\n何似琅琊邸，亭亭玉十株。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42584,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇园杂咏四十三首 其六 误游磴","author":"王世贞","text":"纵呼误游磴，胜事无不真。\n惟嫌入山客，唤作出山人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42585,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弇园杂咏四十三首 其七 香雪径","author":"王世贞","text":"李白媚杨白，浪夸春雪香。\n除却江家女，谁花可得当。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42586,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]